WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Indoor mall visits rose 5% year over year in August 2026.
Source: Placer.ai, August 2026 Mall Index

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
How can malls turn that growing foot traffic into more sales for the businesses inside?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Meet Ruru—a friendly robot resident of the mall.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
She gets to know shoppers and connects them with stores, offers and events they’d love.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.788
Ruru: Hello! I haven’t seen you here before. What’s your name?

00:00:26.438 --> 00:00:27.430
Brian: My name’s Brian!

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.428
Ruru: Hi Brian! You look drenched. You can get an umbrella at 7-Eleven. Have a discount on me!

00:00:35.078 --> 00:00:38.239
Brian: Thanks! I was out for a run and got caught in the rain.

00:00:38.889 --> 00:00:41.397
Ruru: Well, let’s get you dry first!

00:00:46.447 --> 00:00:49.137
Ruru: Hey Brian! You don’t look as wet today.

00:00:49.787 --> 00:00:52.635
Brian: Your umbrella was so helpful. Thanks so much!

00:00:53.285 --> 00:00:55.636
Ruru: You’re welcome! Been out running again?

00:00:56.286 --> 00:00:58.558
Brian: Yes! Much better weather this time.

00:00:59.208 --> 00:01:04.694
Ruru: Then you might like this. Lululemon’s having an event today. Come check it out!

00:01:05.344 --> 00:01:09.053
Ruru: By the way, you’re not on the mailing list. Want to be added?

00:01:09.703 --> 00:01:11.114
Brian: Yeah, I’d love that!

00:01:11.764 --> 00:01:14.455
Ruru: Scan my face. I’ll keep you posted!

00:01:30.605 --> 00:01:32.407
Brian: Good looking out, Ruru!

00:01:33.057 --> 00:01:34.781
Ruru: That’s what I’m here for!

00:02:02.631 --> 00:02:05.635
Ruru: Hello! I haven’t seen you here before.

